#: Localization/Data/BuildingItems.csv
msgctxt "BuildingItems,Building_Bedroll02_Name"
msgid "Простая кровать с изголовьем"
msgstr "Simple Bed with Headboard"

#. Key:	Building_Bedroll0_T04_Cool_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/BuildingItems.csv
#: Localization/Data/BuildingItems.csv
msgctxt "BuildingItems,Building_Bedroll0_T04_Cool_Description"
msgid "Роскошная кровать, будто созданная для тех, кто привык спать в объятиях мягкости и величия\r\n\r\nПозволяет сохранять точку возрождения\r\n\r\nТребует крышу\r\n\r\nКомфорт +2\r\nБонусы комфорта в категории не суммируются"
msgstr "A luxurious bed, fit for those who are used to sleeping wrapped in softness and grandeur.\r\n\r\nAllows to set your revival point.\r\n\r\nRequires a roof.\r\n\r\nComfort +2\r\nComfort bonuses in this category do not stack"

#. Key:	Building_Bedroll_T02_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/BuildingItems.csv
#: Localization/Data/BuildingItems.csv
msgctxt "BuildingItems,Building_Bedroll_T02_Description"
msgid "Кровать созданная для отдыха после долгой охоты\r\n\r\nПозволяет сохранять точку возрождения\r\n\r\nТребует крышу\r\n\r\nКомфорт +2\r\nБонусы комфорта в категории не суммируются"
msgstr "A bed made for resting after a long hunt\r\n\r\nAllows to set your revival point.\r\n\r\nRequires a roof.\r\n\r\nComfort +2\r\nComfort bonuses in this category do not stack"

#. Key:	Building_Bedroll_T04_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/BuildingItems.csv
#: Localization/Data/BuildingItems.csv
msgctxt "BuildingItems,Building_Bedroll_T04_Description"
msgid "Прочная и добротная кровать, в которой надёжность сочетается с изяществом\r\n\r\nПозволяет сохранять точку возрождения\r\n\r\nТребует крышу\r\n\r\nКомфорт +2\r\nБонусы комфорта в категории не суммируются"
msgstr "A sturdy, well-made bed where reliability meets elegance\r\n\r\nAllows to set your revival point.\r\n\r\nRequires a roof.\r\n\r\nComfort +2\r\nComfort bonuses in this category do not stack"

#. Key:	Building_BuildingCenter_Descriptions
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/BuildingItems.csv
#: Localization/Data/BuildingItems.csv
msgctxt "BuildingItems,Building_BuildingCenter_Descriptions"
msgid "This is the heart of your settlement—without it, most workbenches and crafting stations won’t function.\r\n\r\nThis is the place where you can rest and get Rested effect that improves your Stamina Recovery Rate\r\n\r\nComfort +1"
msgstr "This is the heart of your camp—without it, most workbenches and crafting stations won’t function.\r\n\r\nThis is the place where you can rest and get Rested effect that improves your Stamina Recovery Rate.\r\n\r\nComfort +1"

