#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/CharacterUI.csv
#: Localization/Data/CharacterUI.csv
msgctxt "CharacterUI,CharacterStat_Name_AttackPower_Desc"
msgid "Attack Power (ATK) defines your character's offensive capabilities. Higher ATK allows you to deal more damage to higher level enemies.\r\n\r\nThis value is defined by the weapon you have equipped."
msgstr "Attack Power (ATK) defines your character's offensive capabilities. Higher ATK allows you to deal more damage to higher level enemies.\r\n\r\nThis value is defined by the weapon you have equipped."

#. Key:	CharacterStat_Name_DefencePower
