#. Key:	CharacterStat_Name_DefencePower_Desc
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/CharacterUI.csv
#: Localization/Data/CharacterUI.csv
msgctxt "CharacterUI,CharacterStat_Name_DefencePower_Desc"
msgid "Defence Power (DEF) defines your character's defensive capabilities. Higher DEF reduces the Damage you take from enemies.\r\n\r\nThis value is calculated as the average DEF of all armor pieces you have equipped."
msgstr "Defence Power (DEF) defines your character's defensive capabilities. Higher DEF reduces the Damage you take from enemies.\r\n\r\nThis value is calculated as the average DEF of all armor pieces you have equipped."

