#. Key:	CharacterStats_Agility_TooltipRichDescription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/CharacterUI.csv
#: Localization/Data/CharacterUI.csv
msgctxt "CharacterUI,CharacterStats_Agility_TooltipRichDescription"
msgid "<img id=\"IconAgility\"/> <T_BOLD>Agility</>\r\n\r\nIncreases effectiveness of <T_BOLD>Agility based weapons</>.\r\n\r\nAgility based weapons are usually weapons such as Sabers and Greatswords as well as Musketons.\r\n\r\nCould be increased by applying Stat points to Agility, consuming food with Agility buffs as well as through various Equipment items."
msgstr "<img id=\"IconAgility\"/> <T_BOLD>Agility</>\r\n\r\nIncreases damage of <T_BOLD>Agility based weapons</>.\r\n\r\nAgility based weapons are usually weapons such as Sabers and Greatswords as well as Blunderbusses.\r\n\r\nCould be increased by applying Stat points to Agility, consuming food with Agility buffs as well as through various Equipment items."

