msgstr "Having refused to side with Blackbeard, the buccaneers have become his prey. Their camp is little more than a hard-bitten refuge for hunters and fighters who still refuse to bend the knee.\r\n\r\nWilling to buy the following goods:\r\nSpirits, Munitions"

