#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Environment.csv
#: Localization/Data/Environment.csv
msgctxt "Environment,POI_Trade_Civilians_Description"
msgid "The people of Tortuga fled the city after the undead invasion and raised a desperate camp around the late governor's mansion. Amid the chaos, they cling to this battered refuge and fight to survive another day.\r\n\r\nWilling to buy the following goods:\r\nProvisions, Medicine"
