#: Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
msgctxt "LoadingHints,LoadingHint_12"
msgid "Чтобы взять корабль на абордаж, сначала замедлите его пушечным огнём."
msgstr "To board a ship, slow it down with cannon fire first."

#. Key:	LoadingHint_13
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
#. InfoMetaData:	"Context" : "no more than 200 characters"
#: Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
msgctxt "LoadingHints,LoadingHint_13"
msgid "Не хватает частей понравившегося набора брони? Купите рецепт на Тортуге и создайте его самостоятельно."
msgstr "Missing pieces of an armor set you like? Buy the plan in Tortuga and craft it yourself."

#. Key:	LoadingHint_14
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
#. InfoMetaData:	"Context" : "no more than 200 characters"
#: Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
msgctxt "LoadingHints,LoadingHint_14"
msgid "Чтобы менять оснастку корабля, необходимо находиться рядом с построенной вами верфью."
msgstr "To change your ship’s fittings, you must be near a Wharf you’ve built."

#. Key:	LoadingHint_2
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
#. InfoMetaData:	"Context" : "no more than 200 characters"
#: Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
msgctxt "LoadingHints,LoadingHint_2"
msgid "Stand near the bonfire in your base to gain the Rested buff which makes your Stamina recover faster. A well decorated and furnished base base makes this buff stronger."
msgstr "Stand near the bonfire in your base to gain the Rested buff which makes your Stamina recover faster. A well decorated and furnished base makes this buff stronger."

#. Key:	LoadingHint_3
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
#. InfoMetaData:	"Context" : "no more than 200 characters"
#: Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
msgctxt "LoadingHints,LoadingHint_3"
msgid "Быстрая стройка (Drag build). После установки блока удерживайте ЛКМ и двигайте камеру в нужную сторону, чтобы автоматически продолжить строительство."
msgstr "Fast Building (Drag Build). Place a block, then hold LMB and move the camera to automatically keep building in that direction."

#. Key:	LoadingHint_4
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
#. InfoMetaData:	"Context" : "no more than 200 characters"
#: Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
msgctxt "LoadingHints,LoadingHint_4"
msgid "Поставив блок в нужный момент, можно выполнить парирование удара. Вы не теряете очки стойкости, а противник — теряет. (Perfect Block, Posture)"
msgstr "Block at the right moment to perform a Perfect Block. You won’t lose Posture, but your enemy will."

#. Key:	LoadingHint_5
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
#. InfoMetaData:	"Context" : "no more than 200 characters"
#: Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
msgctxt "LoadingHints,LoadingHint_5"
msgid "Корабль можно вызвать в любой момент кнопкой [K]. Держите в трюме еду, снадобья, бинты и немного строительных материалов, никогда не знаешь, что ждет на следующем острове."
msgstr "You can summon your Flagship at any time with [K]. Keep food, potions, bandages, and a bit of building materials in the hold—you never know what awaits on the next island."

#. Key:	LoadingHint_6
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
#. InfoMetaData:	"Context" : "no more than 200 characters"
#: Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
msgctxt "LoadingHints,LoadingHint_6"
msgid "Your ship gives you a Rested bonus as strong as the one from your most comfortable base."
msgstr "Your ship gives you a Rested bonus as strong as the one from your most comfortable base."

#. Key:	LoadingHint_7
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
#. InfoMetaData:	"Context" : "no more than 200 characters"
#: Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
msgctxt "LoadingHints,LoadingHint_7"
msgid "Находясь на корабле или лодке, нажмите [M], чтобы открыть карту мира и переместиться к Колоколу быстрого перемещения."
msgstr "While steering a ship or boat, press [M] to open the World Map and travel to the Fast Travel Bell."

#. Key:	LoadingHint_8
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
#. InfoMetaData:	"Context" : "no more than 200 characters"
#: Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
msgctxt "LoadingHints,LoadingHint_8"
msgid "Декорации повышают комфорт базы. Чем выше комфорт, тем быстрее восстанавливается выносливость во время путешествий. (Stamina)"
msgstr "Decorations increase your base’s Comfort. The higher your Comfort, the stronger the Rested buff you get."

#. Key:	LoadingHint_9
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
#. InfoMetaData:	"Context" : "no more than 200 characters"
#: Localization/Data/LoadingHints.csv
msgctxt "LoadingHints,LoadingHint_9"
msgid "Для стрельбы необходимы пули и порох."
msgstr "Shooting requires bullets and gunpowder."

