#: Localization/Data/LobbyUI.csv
msgctxt "LobbyUI,Lobby_DifficultySelecton_Coop_StatsCorrectionModifier_Desc"
msgid "Adjusts enemy Health and how fast enemies lose Posture based on the number of players on the server."
msgstr "Adjusts enemy Health and how fast enemies lose Posture based on the number of players on the server (doesn't scale after 5th player).\r\n\r\nScaling is non-linear, up to 30% additional Posture resistance and 60% additional Health at 5 players.\r\nScaling at 50% means enemies will have 30% additional Health at 5 players.\r\nScaling at 200% means enemies will have 120% additional Health at 5 players."

