#. Key:	Lobby_Info_AlphaInfo
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LobbyUI.csv
#: Localization/Data/LobbyUI.csv
msgctxt "LobbyUI,Lobby_Info_AlphaInfo"
msgid "This demo version was created so you can get acquainted with the game’s world, its atmosphere, and the first mechanics. The content here is limited, and some elements will still be refined and changed as the project develops.\r\n\r\nIf you enjoyed it, we’d be glad to hear your feedback. It truly helps us move in the right direction. This is only the beginning of the journey—many discoveries lie ahead.\r\n\r\nAdd Windrose to your wishlist and drop by our Discord—it's where a community of brave sea wolves and the development team come together."
msgstr "This demo version was created so you can get acquainted with the game’s world, its atmosphere, and the first mechanics. The content here is limited, and some elements will still be refined and changed as the project develops.\r\n\r\nIf you enjoyed it, we’d be glad to hear your feedback. It truly helps us move in the right direction. This is only the beginning of the journey—many discoveries lie ahead.\r\n\r\nAdd Windrose to your wishlist and drop by our Discord—it's where a community of brave sea wolves and the development team come together."

#. Key:	Lobby_Info_EA_Info
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LobbyUI.csv
#: Localization/Data/LobbyUI.csv
msgctxt "LobbyUI,Lobby_Info_EA_Info"
msgid "Thank you for your support and for being with us! \r\n \r\nYou’re playing Windrose during its Early Access stage — the game is still actively evolving. Bugs, rough edges, and changes to mechanics are to be expected. Not everything is perfect yet, but we believe that creating a truly great game is only possible together with you. We carefully read your feedback and do our best to take it into account as development continues. Your support means a great deal to us.\r\n\r\nThe sea is already calling, and the adventure is only gaining momentum. Follow updates on the store page and join our Discord to stay connected with us and with other captains."
msgstr "Thank you for your support and for being with us! \r\n \r\nYou’re playing Windrose during its Early Access stage — the game is still actively evolving. Bugs, rough edges, and changes to mechanics are to be expected. Not everything is perfect yet, but we believe that creating a truly great game is only possible together with you. We carefully read your feedback and do our best to take it into account as development continues. Your support means a great deal to us.\r\n\r\nThe sea is already calling, and the adventure is only gaining momentum. Follow updates on the store page and join our Discord to stay connected with us and with other captains."

#. Key:	Lobby_PersonalId_Warning
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LobbyUI.csv
#: Localization/Data/LobbyUI.csv
msgctxt "LobbyUI,Lobby_PersonalId_Warning"
msgid "Your personal ID is permanent and can’t be changed. It allows unlimited players to join, but only 4 can be online at once in your world. There are no passwords or reset options yet. If you share it, ANYONE can join — and you can’t undo it. Share carefully, only with those you trust!"
msgstr "Your personal ID is permanent and can’t be changed. It allows unlimited players to join, but only 4 can be online at once in your world. There are no passwords or reset options yet. If you share it, ANYONE can join — and you can’t undo it. Share carefully, only with those you trust!"

