#. Key:	Lobby_ServerConnection_ForceRelayDescription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LobbyUI.csv
#: Localization/Data/LobbyUI.csv
msgctxt "LobbyUI,Lobby_ServerConnection_ForceRelayDescription"
msgid "<T_BOLD>EXPERIMENTAL. Only try this option if you cannot connect to your friend’s server. This does not work with Direct IP connections.</>\r\n\r\nSometimes players are unable to connect directly to their friends’ games because P2P traffic is blocked along the route. This can happen for many reasons, such as router settings, ISP restrictions, firewall restrictions, and more. Enabling this option will route your traffic through a special relay service, which may help bypass these restrictions.\r\n \r\n<T_NEG>Please note that enabling this option may increase your ping.</>"
msgstr "<T_BOLD>EXPERIMENTAL. Only try this option if you cannot connect to your friend’s server. This does not work with Direct IP connections.</>\r\n\r\nSometimes players are unable to connect directly to their friends’ games because P2P traffic is blocked along the route. This can happen for many reasons, such as router settings, ISP restrictions, firewall restrictions, and more. Enabling this option will route your traffic through a special relay service, which may help bypass these restrictions.\r\n \r\n<T_NEG>Please note that enabling this option may increase your ping.</>"

