#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LobbyUI.csv
#: Localization/Data/LobbyUI.csv
msgctxt "LobbyUI,Playscreen_Text_CoopDescription"
msgid "You will join your friend’s adventure. Your character’s inventory is shared across all archipelagos.\r\n\r\nYou can join a server <T_BOLD>only within your region.</>\r\n\r\n<T_GOLD>To access the adventure, your friend’s personal ID is required:</>"
msgstr "You will join your friend’s adventure. Your character’s inventory is shared across all archipelagos.\r\n\r\nYou can join a server <T_BOLD>only within your region.</>\r\n\r\n<T_GOLD>To access the adventure, your friend’s personal ID is required:</>"

#. Key:	Playscreen_Text_PersonalDescription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/LobbyUI.csv
#: Localization/Data/LobbyUI.csv
msgctxt "LobbyUI,Playscreen_Text_PersonalDescription"
msgid "Share your personal ID with a friend so they can connect to your server. The personal ID cannot be changed. It allows an unlimited number of friends to connect, but only 4 can be in your world at the same time.\r\n\r\n<T_NEG>At the moment, it is not possible to set a password or remove players from the world. Anyone who has your ID will be able to enter your world. Share your ID only with people you trust!</>\r\n\r\nA friend will be able to join your server <T_BOLD>only if they are in the same region as you.</>\r\n\r\n<T_GOLD>Your personal ID:</>"
msgstr "Share your personal ID with a friend so they can connect to your server. The personal ID cannot be changed. It allows an unlimited number of friends to connect, but only 4 can be in your world at the same time.\r\n\r\n<T_NEG>At the moment, it is not possible to set a password or remove players from the world. Anyone who has your ID will be able to enter your world. Share your ID only with people you trust!</>\r\n\r\nA friend will be able to join your server <T_BOLD>only if they are in the same region as you.</>\r\n\r\n<T_GOLD>Your personal ID:</>"

