#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_Notes_ForgottenRelic_MuralStory_Core"
msgid "История жрицы. Копии фресок"
msgstr "The Priestess’s Tale (Mural Copies)"

#. Key:	Quest_Notes_JokesOfTheGods_Core
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_Notes_JokesOfTheGods_Core"
msgid "История жреца Ицельтека"
msgstr "The Itzeltek Priest’s Story"

#. Key:	Quest_Notes_MainQuest_ScaredPirate_Core
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_Notes_MainQuest_ScaredPirate_Core"
msgid "Журнал испуганного пирата"
msgstr "Frightened Pirate’s Journal"

#. Key:	Quest_Notes_Robinson_Core
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_Notes_Robinson_Core"
msgid "Потерпевший кораблекрушение"
msgstr "Castaway"

#. Key:	Quest_Notes_SpanishExpedition_Core
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_Notes_SpanishExpedition_Core"
msgid "Воспоминания призрака"
msgstr "Memories of a Ghost"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_BucaneerNotes_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_BucaneerNotes_Name"
msgid "Записи Марселя Буше"
msgstr "Marcel Boucher’s notes"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_DeadmanChest_Core_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_DeadmanChest_Core_Description"
msgid "Среди обломков на берегу лежал скелет пирата. В записке, которая валялась рядом, он упомянул закопанный сундук с золотом. "
msgstr "Among the wreckage on the shore I found a pirate’s skeleton. A note lying nearby mentioned a buried chest of gold."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_DeadmanChest_Core_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_DeadmanChest_Core_Name"
msgid "Пятнадцать человек на сундук мертвеца"
msgstr "Fifteen Men on a Dead Man’s Chest"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_DeadmanChest_Core_Result
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_DeadmanChest_Core_Result"
msgid "Пират убил свою команду, чтобы не делиться добычей. Кто же знал, что они вернутся с того света ради мести и своих сокровищ. Только мертвецам золото ни к чему."
msgstr "The pirate killed his crew rather than share the loot. Who would’ve thought they’d return from the grave for revenge—and their treasure? Still, gold is no use to the dead."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_DeadmanChest_Sub1_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_DeadmanChest_Sub1_Description"
msgid "Пират был так любезен, что оставил в записке пометку о том, где спрятал сундук. Надо бы проверить это место."
msgstr "The pirate was kind enough to note where he’d hidden the chest. I’d best check the spot."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_DeadmanChest_Sub1_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_DeadmanChest_Sub1_Goal"
msgid "Найти сундук пирата"
msgstr "Find the Pirate’s Chest"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_FearHasBigEyes_Core_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_FearHasBigEyes_Core_Description"
msgid "Ко мне попали страницы из дневника человека, который, как и я, потерпел крушение на острове и пытался выжить."
msgstr "I came across pages from the journal of another man who, like me, was shipwrecked and struggled to survive."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_FearHasBigEyes_Core_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_FearHasBigEyes_Core_Name"
msgid "У страха глаза велики"
msgstr "Eyes Wide with Fear"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_FearHasBigEyes_Core_Result
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_FearHasBigEyes_Core_Result"
msgid "Одиночество и страх сводят с ума. Вместе с вещами в сундуке были закопаны два тела. Скорее всего, это те люди, которых безумец упоминал в своем дневнике."
msgstr "Isolation and fear can drive a man mad. Alongside the belongings in the chest, two bodies were buried. Most likely, they’re the ones the madman wrote about in his journal."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_FearHasBigEyes_Sub1_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_FearHasBigEyes_Sub1_Description"
msgid "Возможно, мне удастся узнать, что произошло с этими людьми."
msgstr "Maybe I can find out what happened to these people."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_FearHasBigEyes_Sub1_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_FearHasBigEyes_Sub1_Goal"
msgid "Узнать историю выживших"
msgstr "Uncover the Survivors’ Story"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_FearHasBigEyes_Sub2_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_FearHasBigEyes_Sub2_Description"
msgid "Где-то здесь он закопал свои вещи. Ему они больше не понадобятся, а вот мне могут пригодиться."
msgstr "He buried his belongings somewhere nearby. He won’t need them anymore, but they might come in handy for me."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_FearHasBigEyes_Sub2_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_FearHasBigEyes_Sub2_Goal"
msgid "Найти сундук сумасшедшего"
msgstr "Find the Madman’s Chest"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_TidyYourselfUp_Hint_BuildCooking
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_TidyYourselfUp_Hint_BuildCooking"
msgid "Разведите Костер для готовки. Нажмите <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildMode\"/>, чтобы перейти в режим Стройки, и нажмите <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildSelection\"/> для выбора постройки"
msgstr "Build a Cooking Fire. Press <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildMode\"/> to enter Building Mode, then press <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildSelection\"/> to select a structure."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_TidyYourselfUp_Hint_BuildHouse
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_TidyYourselfUp_Hint_BuildHouse"
msgid "Постройте Палатку. Нажмите <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildMode\"/>, чтобы перейти в режим Стройки, и нажмите <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildSelection\"/> для выбора постройки"
msgstr "Build a Tent. Press <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildMode\"/> to enter Building Mode, then press <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildSelection\"/> to select a structure."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_TidyYourselfUp_Hint_BuildUpgrade
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_TidyYourselfUp_Hint_BuildUpgrade"
msgid "Поставьте Стол для улучшений. Нажмите <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildMode\"/>, чтобы перейти в режим Стройки, и нажмите <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildSelection\"/> для выбора постройки"
msgstr "Build Upgrade Table. Press <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildMode\"/> to enter Building Mode, then press <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildSelection\"/> to select a structure."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_TidyYourselfUp_Hint_BuildWorkbench
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_TidyYourselfUp_Hint_BuildWorkbench"
msgid "Поставьте Верстак. Нажмите <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildMode\"/>\r\n , чтобы перейти в режим Стройки, и нажмите <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildSelection\"/> для выбора постройки"
msgstr "Build Workbench. Press <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildMode\"/> to enter Building Mode, then press <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_BuildSelection\"/> to select a structure."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_TidyYourselfUp_Hint_GetBuff
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_TidyYourselfUp_Hint_GetBuff"
msgid "NOT USED Outdated buff"
msgstr "NOT USED Outdated buff"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_CJ_TidyYourselfUp_Hint_UseSavepoint
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_CJ_TidyYourselfUp_Hint_UseSavepoint"
msgid "Нажмите <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_Interact\"/> на Палатке, чтобы установить точку возрождения"
msgstr "Press <img width=\"desired\" height=\"desired\" id=\"Action_Interact\"/> at the Tent to set the revival point"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FateOfTheProphets_Core_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FateOfTheProphets_Core_Description"
msgid "Руины Болот скрывают множество секретов и сокровищ, оставшихся от древнего народа. Любопытно, какую историю скрывают в себе эти стены."
msgstr "The Swamp Ruins hide countless secrets and treasures left behind by an ancient people. I can’t help but wonder what stories these walls hold."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FateOfTheProphets_Core_Result
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FateOfTheProphets_Core_Result"
msgid "Похоже, не только в Старом Свете прорицателей убивали за плохие предсказания..."
msgstr "It seems killing prophets for their grim predictions wasn’t just an Old World thing after all…"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FateOfTheProphets_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FateOfTheProphets_Name"
msgid "Судьба пророков"
msgstr "Fate of the Prophets"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FateOfTheProphets_Sub01_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FateOfTheProphets_Sub01_Desription"
msgid "Остатки сооружения напоминают обсерваторию. Возможно, неподалеку найдется еще парочка?"
msgstr "The remains of this structure resemble an observatory. Perhaps there are more of them around?"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FateOfTheProphets_Sub01_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FateOfTheProphets_Sub01_Goal"
msgid "Исследовать древние обсерватории"
msgstr "Explore the ancient observatories"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FateOfTheProphets_Sub02_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FateOfTheProphets_Sub02_Desription"
msgid "В потайном зале мне попались предсмертные записи замурованых звездочетов. Их убил военачальник из-за дурных, но, судя по всему, правдивых предсказаний. Последнее из них гласило, что его самого утопят в болотах неподалеку отсюда. Военачальник наверняка был довольно знатным и, самое главное, богатым, человеком..."
msgstr "In a hidden chamber, I found the final writings of stargazers sealed alive within the walls. A warlord had them killed for predicting misfortune, though it seems they were correct. The last foretold his own death: drowned in the nearby swamps. The warlord must have been a man of great status… and, more importantly, wealth."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FateOfTheProphets_Sub02_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FateOfTheProphets_Sub02_Goal"
msgid "Отыскать место смерти военачальника"
msgstr "Find the warlord’s death site"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Core_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Core_Description"
msgid "Пиратам кто-то сдал маршрут моего корабля. Доктор Гален уверен, что этот предатель находится в окружении губернатора."
msgstr "Someone tipped the pirates off about my ship’s route. Doctor Galen is convinced that the traitor is among the Governor’s inner circle."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Core_Result
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Core_Result"
msgid "Предатель найден и понесет наказание."
msgstr "The traitor has been found and will face punishment."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Name"
msgid "Горькая пилюля"
msgstr "The Bitter Pill"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub01_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub01_Desription"
msgid "Томас Ричардс точно знал, что Гален вез артефакт на моем корабле. Нужно выяснить, как к нему попали эти сведения."
msgstr "Thomas Richards knew Galen was transporting the artifact aboard my ship. I need to find out how he obtained this information."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub01_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub01_Goal"
msgid "Проникнуть в лагерь Ричардса"
msgstr "Infiltrate Richards’ camp"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub02_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub02_Desription"
msgid "Возможно, в основном лагере пиратов найдутся ниточки, которые приведут меня к предателю."
msgstr "There may be clues at the pirates’ main camp that will lead me to the traitor."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub02_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub02_Goal"
msgid "Обыскать лагерь Ричардса"
msgstr "Search Richards’ camp"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub03_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub03_Desription"
msgid "Мне попалось письмо, адресованное Черной Бороде. Его отправитель не только рассказал об артефакте, но и организовал поставки пороха пиратам. Нужно сообщить об этом Галену."
msgstr "I found a letter addressed to Blackbeard. The sender not only mentioned the artifact, but also supplied the pirates with gunpowder. I should let Galen know about this."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub03_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub03_Goal"
msgid "Обсудить письмо с доктором Галеном"
msgstr "Discuss the letter with Doctor Galen"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub04_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub04_Desription"
msgid "Одного письма слишком мало, чтобы убедить Галена в предательстве друга. А вот упомянутые ящики с порохом могут послужить неплохим доказательством."
msgstr "One letter isn’t enough to convince Galen of his friend’s betrayal. However, the gunpowder crates mentioned in it could serve as solid proof."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub04_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub04_Goal"
msgid "Отыскать ящики с порохом"
msgstr "Find the gunpowder crates"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub05_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub05_Desription"
msgid "Франсуа Арно действительно поставлял порох пиратам. На сундуках красовался знак его торговой компании. Гален должен об этом узнать."
msgstr "François Arnaud was indeed supplying the pirates with gunpowder — his company’s mark was clearly visible on the crates. I should let Galen know about this."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub05_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub05_Goal"
msgid "Поговорить с Галеном"
msgstr "Talk to Doctor Galen"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub06_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub06_Desription"
msgid "Гален хочет узнать, почему тот, кого он считал другом, пошел на предательство. Нужно поговорить с Франсуа Арно на Тортуге и вывести его на чистую воду."
msgstr "Galen wants to know why someone he thought to be his friend chose betrayal. I should speak to François Arnaud on Tortuga and bring the truth to light."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub06_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub06_Goal"
msgid "Найти Франсуа Арно на Тортуге"
msgstr "Find François Arnaud on Tortuga"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub07_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub07_Desription"
msgid "Франсуа Арно сознался в предательстве губернатора и понесет справедливое наказание. Однако он попросил спасти своего сына Жака, которого пираты держат в заложниках на одном из своих кораблей... В качестве последней просьбы."
msgstr "François Arnaud confessed to betraying the governor and will receive a just punishment. Still, he asked me to rescue his son, Jacques Arnaud, whom the pirates are holding hostage aboard one of their ships… as a last request."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub07_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub07_Goal"
msgid "Спасти Жака Арно из плена на пиратском корабле"
msgstr "Rescue Jacques Arnaud from captivity aboard a pirate ship"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub08_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub08_Desription"
msgid "Мне стало известно, что Жак Арно сговорился с пиратами и сам шантажировал своего отца. Во время абордажа он был смертельно ранен. Теперь надо понять, что сказать Франсуа."
msgstr "I learned that Jacques Arnaud had been secretly working with the pirates and blackmailing his own father. He was mortally wounded when we boarded the ship. Now I should decide what to tell François."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub08_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub08_Goal"
msgid "Рассказать Франсуа Арно о судьбе сына"
msgstr "Tell François Arnaud of his son’s fate"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub09_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub09_Desription"
msgid "Франсуа был безутешен. Доктор Гален тоже должен узнать правду о мотивах своего друга. В этот раз я найду его в таверне на Тортуге."
msgstr "François was devastated. Doctor Galen must also learn the truth about his friend’s motives. This time, I’ll find him at the tavern on Tortuga."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub09_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_FindingTraitor_Sub09_Goal"
msgid "Поговорить с Галеном в таверне на Тортуге"
msgstr "Talk to Galen at the tavern on Tortuga"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Core_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Core_Description"
msgid "I’ve heard there’s an old fort in Ashlands, buried under a layer of volcanic ash along with all the inhabitants and their secrets. I should definitely check it out."
msgstr "I’ve heard there’s an old fort in Ashlands, buried under a layer of volcanic ash along with all the inhabitants and their secrets. I should definitely check it out."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Core_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Core_Name"
msgid "The Mystery of the Old Fort"
msgstr "The Mystery of the Old Fort"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Core_Result
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Core_Result"
msgid "I'm lucky. There was a real treasure inside."
msgstr "I'm lucky. There was a real treasure inside."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Sub0_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Sub0_Description"
msgid "Something useful might be hidden among the mist and ruins."
msgstr "Something useful might be hidden among the mist and ruins."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Sub0_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Sub0_Goal"
msgid "Explore the old fort in Ashlands"
msgstr "Explore the old fort in Ashlands"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Sub1_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Sub1_Description"
msgid "There was an iron key and a captain's log, which mentioned some kind of vault. The text also says there are only three keys. I've already got one – two more to find."
msgstr "There was an iron key and a captain's log, which mentioned some kind of vault. The text also says there are only three keys. I've already got one – two more to find."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Sub1_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Sub1_Goal"
msgid "Find the remaining keys"
msgstr "Find the remaining keys"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Sub2_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Sub2_Description"
msgid "I've found the keys, now I need to hurry and open the vault door."
msgstr "I've found the keys, now I need to hurry and open the vault door."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Sub2_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_GamescomBuriedRuin_Sub2_Goal"
msgid "Open the vault door"
msgstr "Open the vault door"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Core_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Core_Description"
msgid "Во время атаки на Тортугу Эдвард Тич почти уничтожил Береговое Братство. Их силы разрозненны, а корабли Стида Боннета – еще одного помощника Черной Бороды – охотятся за выжившими."
msgstr "Edward Teach nearly destroyed the Brethren of the Coast during his assault on Tortuga. Their forces are scattered, and Stede Bonnet’s ships—another of Blackbeard’s lieutenants—are hunting down the survivors."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Core_Result
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Core_Result"
msgid "Береговому Братству с моей помощью удалось избавиться от пиратского флота Стида Боннета."
msgstr "With my help, Brethren of the Coast defeated Bonnet’s fleet."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Name"
msgid "Береговое Братство"
msgstr "Brethren of The Coast"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub01_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub01_Desription"
msgid "После атаки пиратов Братство потеряло много кораблей и людей. Капитан Бенджами Хорниголд попросил меня отыскать его друзей. В качестве награды он обещал сведения об артефакте губернатора."
msgstr "After the pirate attack, the Brethren of the Coast lost many ships and men. Benjamin Hornigold asked me to track down his friends. In return, he promised information about the governor’s artifact."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub01_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub01_Goal"
msgid "Разыскать выживших"
msgstr "Find the survivors"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub02_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub02_Desription"
msgid "Корабли лежат на мели, мачты сломаны, палубы залиты кровью. Пираты и утопленники не оставили никого в живых. Капитана Хорниголда ждут плохие вести."
msgstr "The ships lie aground, their masts shattered, their decks drenched in blood. Pirates and drowned left no survivors. Captain Hornigold is in for some bad news."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub02_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub02_Goal"
msgid "Сообщить капитану Хорниголду о смерти товарищей"
msgstr "Tell Captain Hornigold of his friends’ demise"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub03_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub03_Desription"
msgid "Нужно отправиться в море и потопить пиратские корабли, патрулирующие окрестности."
msgstr "I have to set sail and sink pirate ships that patrol the area."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub03_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub03_Goal"
msgid "Уничтожить два пиратских патруля"
msgstr "Destroy two pirate patrols"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub04_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub04_Desription"
msgid "У меня получилось избавиться от патрулей. Пора сообщить об этом капитану Хорниголду."
msgstr "I managed to deal with the patrols. It’s time to inform Captain Hornigold."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub04_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub04_Goal"
msgid "Вернуться к капитану Хорниголду"
msgstr "Return to Captain Hornigold"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub05_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub05_Desription"
msgid "Чтобы дать отпор Черной Бороде, Братству нужно восстановить свои корабли. Для этого понадобится 50 досок, 50 единиц деревянного бруса, 50 железных слитков. Как только ресурсы будут собраны, их надо передать капитану Хорниголду."
msgstr "To fight back against Blackbeard, Brethren need to restore their ships. This will require 50 planks, 50 timber, and 50 foothills iron ingots. Once the resources are gathered, deliver them to Captain Hornigold."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub05_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub05_Goal"
msgid "Собрать ресурсы на починку \"Рейнджера\" и отнести их капитану Хорниголду"
msgstr "Gather the resources to repair the Ranger and deliver them to Captain Hornigold."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub06_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub06_Desription"
msgid "Ресурсы были переданы Братству. Самое время узнать, удалось ли капитану Хорниголду восстановить свой корабль."
msgstr "The resources have been delivered to the Brethren. It’s time to find out whether Captain Hornigold has managed to repair his ship."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub06_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub06_Goal"
msgid "Вернуться к капитану Хорниголду"
msgstr "Return to Captain Hornigold."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub07_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub07_Desription"
msgid "\"Рейнджер\" спущен на воду, и Братство готово выступить против Стида Боннета, лейтенанта Черной Бороды, который держит архипелаг в осаде. Пора начинать контратаку."
msgstr "The Ranger has been launched, and the Brethren of the Coast are ready to move against Stede Bonnet—one of Blackbeard’s lieutenants—who has kept the archipelago under siege. It’s time to begin the counterattack."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub07_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub07_Goal"
msgid "Разгромить флот Стида Боннета"
msgstr "Defeat Stede Bonnet’s fleet"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub08_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub08_Desription"
msgid "С флотом Стида Боннета наконец-то покончено. Мне нужно вернуться к капитану Хорниголду – в обмен на помощь он обещал рассказать все, что знает об артефакте."
msgstr "Stede Bonnet’s fleet has finally been dealt with. I need to return to Benjamin Hornigold—he promised to tell me everything he knows about the artifact in return for my help."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub08_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBrethren_Sub08_Goal"
msgid "Вернуться к капитану Хорниголду"
msgstr "Return to Captain Hornigold"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Core_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Core_Description"
msgid "Буканьеры – лучшие стрелки в Карибском море и друзья Братства. Неудивительно, что Черная Борода хочет от них избавиться."
msgstr "The Buccaneers are the finest marksmen in the Caribbean, and allies of the Brethren of the Coast. No wonder Blackbeard wants them gone."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Core_Result
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Core_Result"
msgid "Мне удалось помочь буканьерам и заручиться поддержкой их предводителя."
msgstr "I helped the Buccaneers and secured their leader’s support."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Name"
msgid "Буканьеры"
msgstr "Buccaneers"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub01_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub01_Desription"
msgid "Лагерь буканьеров цел, но едва держится, потому что пираты своими атаками истощили их запасы пороха. Нужно собрать для них полсотни полных пороховых сумок и привезти Анри, иначе охотникам конец."
msgstr "The Buccaneers’ camp is still standing, but only just—pirate attacks have drained their powder stores. I need to gather fifty filled gunpowder bags and deliver them to Henri, or the hunters are done for."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub01_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub01_Goal"
msgid "Собрать 50 сумок пороха для буканьеров и отдать Анри Буше"
msgstr "Get 50 bags of gunpowder for the Buccaneers and deliver them to Henri Boucher"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub02_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub02_Desription"
msgid "Анри поблагодарил за порох и попросил доставить выделанные шкуры Чарли Шарпу в лагерь выживших жителей Тортуги."
msgstr "Henri thanked me for the gunpowder and asked me to deliver the tanned hides to Charlie Sharpe at the People of Tortuga camp."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub02_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub02_Goal"
msgid "Передать партию шкур Чарли Шарпу"
msgstr "Deliver the shipment of tanned hides to Charlie Sharpe"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub03_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#. InfoMetaData:	"Context" : "Skewered Meat"
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub03_Desription"
msgid "Шкуры переданы Чарли Шарпу. Он дал мне бочонок рома для буканьеров и попросил пожарить для них 20 порций кабаньего мяса на палке."
msgstr "I delivered the tanned hides to Charlie Sharpe. Now he asks me to cook 20 Skewered Meat and pass it to Buccaneers alongside a rum barrel."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub03_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#. InfoMetaData:	"Context" : "Skewered Meat"
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub03_Goal"
msgid "Пожарить 20 порций кабаньего мяса на палке"
msgstr "Cook 20 Skewered Meat"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub04_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub04_Desription"
msgid "Мясо готово. Теперь можно вернуться к Анри Буше и передать ему блюда и пузатый бочонок от благодарных жителей."
msgstr "The meat is ready. Now you can return to Henri Boucher and deliver the dishes—and a squat little barrel from the grateful locals."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub04_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#. InfoMetaData:	"Context" : "Skewered Meat"
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingBucaneers_Sub04_Goal"
msgid "Передать Анри Буше 20 порций мяса и ром"
msgstr "Deliver Rum and 20 Skewered Meat to Henri Boucher"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Core_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Core_Description"
msgid "Долговязый Бен обеспокоен тем, что его таверна может остаться без вина, так как у контрабандистов на островах начались проблемы – слишком много пропавших людей и пустых схронов."
msgstr "Long Ben is worried his tavern will run out of wine. The smugglers are in trouble—too many people gone missing, and too many caches turning up empty."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Core_Result
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Core_Result"
msgid "Благодаря мне контрабандисты смогут выполнить заказ и доставить вино в таверну. За мои старания с Долговязого Бена причитается приличная скидка."
msgstr "The smugglers can deliver the wine now—thanks to me. Long Ben owes me a decent discount."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Name"
msgid "Контрабандисты"
msgstr "Smugglers"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub01_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub01_Desription"
msgid "У Долговязого Бена проблемы с поставками вина. Надо отправиться к контрабандистам и узнать что происходит."
msgstr "Long Ben is having trouble with his wine supplies. I should visit the smugglers and find out what is going on."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub01_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub01_Goal"
msgid "Поговорить с главой контрабандистов"
msgstr "Talk to the leader of the Smugglers"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub02_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub02_Desription"
msgid "В лагере контрабандистов командует Марита Суарес. Она беспокоится, что ее корабль с грузом для Бена опаздывает, и попросила проверить, куда он подевался."
msgstr "Marita Suarez commands the smugglers’ camp. Her ship with Ben’s cargo is overdue, and she wants me to find out what happened."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub02_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub02_Goal"
msgid "Найти и обыскать пропавший корабль Мариты"
msgstr "Find and search Marita’s missing ship"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub03_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub03_Desription"
msgid "Груза нет. Команда мертва. Нужно сообщить Марите, что она не зря беспокоилась."
msgstr "There's no cargo. The crew is dead. I need to tell Marita she was right to worry."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub03_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub03_Goal"
msgid "Вернуться к Марите"
msgstr "Return to Marita"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub04_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub04_Desription"
msgid "Марита указала но одно место, где пираты могли бы хранить украденные бутылки. Главное, успеть до того, как их опустошат."
msgstr "Marita gave me a lead on where the pirates might be stashing the stolen bottles. I need to get there before they’re gone—whether from drinking or something else."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub04_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub04_Goal"
msgid "Вернуть украденный груз"
msgstr "Recover the stolen cargo"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub05_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub05_Desription"
msgid "Мне повезло, что пираты не успели открыть бутылки. Точнее, повезло Марите, которая их с нетерпением ждет."
msgstr "Lucky me—the bottles were still sealed when I found them. Or rather, Marita Suarez was the lucky one—she can’t wait to get her hands on them."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub05_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingSmugglers_Sub05_Goal"
msgid "Передать вино Марите"
msgstr "Return the wine to Marita"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Core_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Core_Description"
msgid "Для жителей Тортуги настали трудные времена: губернатор убит, пираты держат под контролем архипелаг, а сам город заполонили утопленники, так что людям пришлось искать приют в ином месте."
msgstr "Hard times came to Tortuga: the governor was killed, pirates seized control of the archipelago, and the town itself was overrun by the drowned, forcing the survivors to seek shelter elsewhere."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Core_Result
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Core_Result"
msgid "Несмотря на то, что город лежит в руинах, ненадолго мне удалось вернуть людям еду, лекарства и надежду на то, что однажды все будет хорошо."
msgstr "The town is in ruins, but I managed—if only briefly—to bring food, medicine, and hope back to its people."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Name"
msgid "Последствия катастрофы"
msgstr "Catastrophe’s Aftermath"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub02_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub02_Desription"
msgid "Жителям не хватает продовольствия, а корабль, который его вез, переполнен утопленниками. Если не вернуть припасы, людям грозит голод."
msgstr "The people are short on food, and the ship meant to deliver it is overrun by the drowned. I have to recover the supplies—or they’ll starve."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub02_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#. InfoMetaData:	"Context" : "Sub01 is missing here, quests starts right from Sub02, that's normal"
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub02_Goal"
msgid "Достать припасы с корабля"
msgstr "Get the supplies from the ship"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub03_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub03_Desription"
msgid "Запасы у меня. Чарли Шарп должен получить их как можно скорее – жителям точно не стоит оставаться без еды."
msgstr "I have the supplies. I should deliver them to Charlie Sharpe as soon as possible — the people can’t afford to go hungry."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub03_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub03_Goal"
msgid "Передать припасы Чарли Шарпу в лагерь беженцев"
msgstr "Bring the supplies to Charlie Sharpe at the refugee camp"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub04_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub04_Desription"
msgid "Чарли Шарп попросил передать доктору Галену, что среди жителей много заболевших и раненых. Им нужны лекарства."
msgstr "Charlie Sharpe asked to inform Doctor Galen that there are many sick and wounded among the refugees. They need medicine."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub04_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub04_Goal"
msgid "Поговорить с доктором Галеном о лекарствах"
msgstr "Talk to Doctor Galen about the medicine"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub05_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub05_Desription"
msgid "Доктор Гален попросил отыскать для него полтора десятка пучков лечебной травы, которые встречаются в руинах. Он уверен, что этого хватит для приготовления лекарств."
msgstr "Doctor Galen asked me to find fifteen bunches of healing herbs that could be found in ruins. He’s confident that will be enough to make the medicine."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub05_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub05_Goal"
msgid "Добыть и передать целебные травы Галену (15 шт.)"
msgstr "Collect 15 bundles of healing herbs and bring them to Galen"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub06_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub06_Desription"
msgid "Гален приготовил лекарственные настои для заболевших в лагере беженцев. Осталось их доставить."
msgstr "Doctor Galen prepared the healing draughts for the sick refugees. Now I just have to deliver them."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub06_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub06_Goal"
msgid "Привезти лекарства Чарли Шарпу"
msgstr "Bring the medicine to Charlie Sharpe"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub07_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub07_Desription"
msgid "Похоже, Джим Годарт, один из пиратских главарей, готовит атаку на беззащитных жителей. Я не дам им превратить людей в товар."
msgstr "It looks like Jim Godart, one of the pirate leaders, is preparing to attack defenseless locals. I won’t let him turn people into cargo."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub07_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub07_Goal"
msgid "Избавиться от Джима Годарта"
msgstr "Get rid of Jim Godart"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub08_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub08_Desription"
msgid "Джим Годарт убит, угроза нападения миновала. Осталось только рассказать об этом Чарли Шарпу."
msgstr "Jim Godart is dead, and the civilians are safe. Now I just need to inform Charlie Sharpe."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub08_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_HelpingTortugaResidents_Sub08_Goal"
msgid "Вернуться к Чарли Шарпу"
msgstr "Return to Charlie Sharpe"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Core_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Core_Description"
msgid "В центре затопленной площадки возвышается старый алтарный камень. На нем записано начало истории о жреце Ицельтека и его дочери."
msgstr "At the centre of the flooded platform stands an ancient stone altar. Carved into it is the beginning of a tale about the Itzeltek's priest and his daughter."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Core_Result
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Core_Result"
msgid "Легенда жреца, расписанная на алтарях, в который раз доказывает, что некоторые запреты лучше не нарушать."
msgstr "The priest’s legend, set down on those altars, is yet another reminder that some things are forbidden for a reason."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Name"
msgid "Шутки богов"
msgstr "Jokes of the Gods"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Sub01_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Sub01_Desription"
msgid "Мне удалось перевести часть легенды о жреце бога мертвых. Было бы неплохо узнать ее продолжение."
msgstr "I managed to translate part of the legend of the priest of the God of the Dead. It would be good to learn how it continues."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Sub01_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Sub01_Goal"
msgid "Найти продолжение легенды"
msgstr "Find the next part of the legend"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Sub02_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Sub02_Desription"
msgid "Обрывать историю жреца мертвых на середине так же нехорошо, как нехорошо оставлять бутылку рома недопитой. Попробую поискать окончание легенды."
msgstr "Leaving the priest’s story unfinished feels just as wrong as leaving a bottle of rum half empty. I’ll try to hunt down the rest of the legend."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Sub02_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Sub02_Goal"
msgid "Отыскать последнюю часть легенды"
msgstr "Find the last part of the legend"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Sub03_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Sub03_Desription"
msgid "Стоило дочитать легенду до конца, как мне на голову свалился недружелюбный крокодил, который жаждет откусить от меня кусок."
msgstr "As soon as I finished reading the legend, I was ambushed by a decidedly unfriendly crocodile eager to take a bite out of me."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Sub03_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_JokesOfTheGods_Sub03_Goal"
msgid "Победить монстра"
msgstr "Defeat the beast"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Core_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Core_Description"
msgid "Мне попался брошеный лагерь буканьеров – охотников на диких свиней. Судя по их записям, пираты напали на них, вынудив защищаться и прятаться в джунглях."
msgstr "I came across an abandoned Buccaneers’ camp. Their notes suggest pirates attacked, forcing them to defend themselves and hide in the jungle."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Core_Result
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Core_Result"
msgid "В знак признательности за помощь, Анри передал мне восстановленный мушкет своего брата."
msgstr "As a token of gratitude, Henri gave me his brother’s restored musket."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Name"
msgid "Славные охотники"
msgstr "Glorious Hunters"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub01_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub01_Desription"
msgid "В этом месте живых людей не осталось – только осиротевшие вещи. Надо проверить другие стоянки."
msgstr "No one is left alive here—only orphaned belongings. I should check the other campsites."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub01_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub01_Goal"
msgid "Найти следы буканьеров"
msgstr "Find any traces of the Buccaneers"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub02_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub02_Desription"
msgid "Похоже, пираты Черной Бороды жестоко расправились с группой буканьеров на этом острове. Наверняка их товарищи захотят узнать о том, что здесь произошло. Заодно выясню, возможно ли восстановить поврежденный мушкет, который валялся в одном из лагерей."
msgstr "It appears Blackbeard’s pirates butchered a group of Buccaneers on this island. Their comrades will want to hear what happened here. While I’m at it, I should see if the damaged musket I found lying in one of the camps can be repaired."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub02_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub02_Goal"
msgid "Сообщить главе буканьеров о смерти его людей"
msgstr "Tell the head of the Buccaneers about the death of his people"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub03_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub03_Desription"
msgid "Анри Буше, глава буканьеров, рассказал, что найденные вещи раньше принадлежали его брату Марселю. После вестей о его смерти Анри попросил отомстить головорезам Черной Бороды и уничтожить три пиратских корабля."
msgstr "Henri Boucher, the leader of the Buccaneers, told me the items I found once belonged to his brother, Marcel. After he learned of Marcel’s death, Henri asked me to avenge him by sinking three of Blackbeard’s ships."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub03_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub03_Goal"
msgid "Уничтожить три пиратских корабля"
msgstr "Destroy three pirate ships"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub04_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub04_Desription"
msgid "Нужно рассказать Анри, что убийцы его брата наказаны."
msgstr "I need to tell Henri that his brother’s killers have been punished."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub04_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_LostExpedition_Sub04_Goal"
msgid "Вернуться к Анри Буше"
msgstr "Return to Henri Boucher"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Core_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Core_Description"
msgid "Кто-то привязал тело человека к штурвалу и оставил умирать, обрекая на долгие мучения..."
msgstr "Somebody tied a man to the ship’s wheel and left him to die a slow, agonizing death…"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Core_Result
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Core_Result"
msgid "Новый Свет привлекает авантюристов отовсюду. Некоторые из них настолько готовы поверить в наступление Рая на земле, что превращаются в яростных фанатиков, лишенных здравого смысла. История \"Нового Ковчега\" окончилась смертью самих сектантов, но оставила после себя больше вопросов, чем ответов."
msgstr "The New World draws adventurers from every corner of the globe. Some believe so deeply in a Heaven on Earth that they become fanatics, losing all sense and reason. The story of the “New Ark” ended with the cultists dead, but it left more questions than answers."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Name"
msgid "Жертвенный агнец"
msgstr "Sacrificial Lamb"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub1_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub1_Description"
msgid "Брошенный труп совсем не похож на работу пиратов. Они предпочитают веревку, пулю или перерезанное горло. Тот, кто подвесил тело, вложил в это дело много усилий."
msgstr "The abandoned corpse doesn’t look like pirate handiwork. They favor rope, lead, or a cut throat. Whoever hung the body meant for it to be seen—and worked hard at it."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub1_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub1_Goal"
msgid "Поискать следы убийц"
msgstr "Look for clues about the killers"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub2_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub2_Description"
msgid "Мне попалось еще несколько привязанных к штурвалу трупов. Стоит отправиться на Тортугу и рассказать об убийствах."
msgstr "I found more corpses tied to ship wheels. I should head to Tortuga and report the murders."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub2_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub2_Goal"
msgid "Сообщить о смертях на Тортугу"
msgstr "Go to Tortuga and report the murders"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub3_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub3_Description"
msgid "Сообщение об убийствах не удивило Бена. Он рассказал, что похожие трупы начали находить на архипелаге еще несколько месяцев назад, и попросил сопроводить свидетеля, так как опасается за его безопасность."
msgstr "Ben wasn’t surprised by the murders. He said similar bodies had been turning up across the archipelago for months and asked me to escort a witness, fearing for his safety."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub3_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub3_Goal"
msgid "Найти свидетеля на корабле"
msgstr "Find the witness on the ship"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub4_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub4_Description"
msgid "Убийцы добрались до свидетеля первыми. В его вещах было письмо на Тортугу, адресованное девушке по имени Летти. Возможно, она что-то знает."
msgstr "The killers got to the witness first. Among his belongings was a letter addressed to a girl named Letty in Tortuga. She might know something."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub4_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub4_Goal"
msgid "Расспросить Летти о сектантах"
msgstr "Ask Letty about the cultists"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub5_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub5_Description"
msgid "Девушка рассказала про секту Детей Ковчега и про корабль, который принадлежит ее главе."
msgstr "The girl told me about a cult known as the Children of the Ark and about the ship belonging to its leader."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub5_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub5_Goal"
msgid "Найти и обыскать корабль \"Новый Ковчег\""
msgstr "Find and search the New Ark"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub6_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub6_Description"
msgid "Корабль \"Новый Ковчег\" стал плавучей могилой для сектантов. Нужно рассказать Долговязому Бену о том, что кто-то избавился от секты раньше нас."
msgstr "The New Ark has become a floating grave for the cultists. I should tell Long Ben that someone dealt with the sect before we did."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub6_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SacrificialLambQuest_Sub6_Goal"
msgid "Вернуться к Долговязому Бену"
msgstr "Return to Long Ben"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Core_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Core_Description"
msgid "Как будто следов на теле мне было мало, теперь я, кажется, вижу призраков, рассказывающих о какой-то испанской экспедиции."
msgstr "As if the marks on my body weren’t enough, now I seem to be seeing ghosts talking about some kind of Spanish expedition."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Core_Result
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Core_Result"
msgid "Среди вещей испанца нашелся точно такой же медальон, что отец отдал мне перед первым плаванием. Не похоже на совпадение. Но откуда он у моей семьи? И что за орден упоминал Хуан де ла Коса? Возможно, когда-нибудь я найду ответы на эти вопросы..."
msgstr "Among the Spaniard’s belongings was a medallion identical to the one my father gave me before my first voyage. Doesn’t seem like a coincidence. How did my family come to possess it? And what was the Order Juan De La Cosa mentioned? Perhaps one day I’ll find the answers…"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Name"
msgid "Тайна экспедиции"
msgstr "Mystery of the Expedition"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Sub01_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Sub01_Desription"
msgid "Мне явился дух испанского моряка, его слова загадочны, но интригующи. Стоит найти остальные захоронения, чтобы узнать больше."
msgstr "I was visited by the ghost of a Spanish sailor. His words were mysterious, yet intriguing. I should find the remaining graves to learn more."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Sub01_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Sub01_Goal"
msgid "Узнать историю экспедиции"
msgstr "Learn more about the expedition"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Sub02_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Sub02_Desription"
msgid "Похоже, что на архипелаге уже были проблемы с восставшими мертвецами. У одной из могил призрак упомянул, что отправляется на место встречи неподалеку от Тортуги. Попробую разыскать его корабль. Скорее всего, мертвецы не дали ему добраться до порта."
msgstr "Seems this isn’t the first time the archipelago has dealt with the undead. A ghost near one of the graves mentioned heading to a meeting place near Turtle Island… that could mean Tortuga. I’ll try to find his ship. The undead likely stopped it before it reached port."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Sub02_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Sub02_Goal"
msgid "Разыскать корабль экспедиции"
msgstr "Find the expedition ship"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Sub03_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Sub03_Desription"
msgid "Корабль действительно разбился. Вокруг него полно утопленников. Стоит очистить палубы и осмотреться."
msgstr "The ship truly was badly wrecked here. It’s surrounded by the drowned. I should clear the decks and look around."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Sub03_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_SpanishExpedition_Sub03_Goal"
msgid "Обыскать корабль"
msgstr "Search the shipwreck"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_TravelersNotes_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_TravelersNotes_Name"
msgid "Записки путешественника"
msgstr "Traveler's notes"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Core_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Core_Description"
msgid "На острове нашелся разгромленый схрон контрабандистов. Похоже, у них неприятности и кто-то целенаправленно за ними охотится."
msgstr "I found a destroyed Smugglers hideout on the island. It seems like they’re in trouble, and someone is targeting them."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Core_Result
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Core_Result"
msgid "Кроме старых добрых пиратов, контрабандистам на Тортуге больше ничего не угрожает. Долговязый Бен получил еще одну любопытную историю в свой арсенал бесконечных баек, а я — доказательство того, что прошлое пиратов редко остается на дне."
msgstr "Besides the usual pirates, nothing else threatens the smugglers anymore. Long Ben got another story for his endless collection, and I got proof that a pirate’s past is rarely buried for long—especially at sea."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Name
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Name"
msgid "Подпольная сеть"
msgstr "Underground Network"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub01_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub01_Desription"
msgid "На Тортуге всегда полно слухов. Стоит поспрашивать в таверне о том, кто охотится на контрабандистов и зачем."
msgstr "Tortuga is alive with rumors. I should ask around in the tavern about who might target the smugglers and why."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub01_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub01_Goal"
msgid "Расспросить на Тортуге о контрабандистах"
msgstr "Ask around on Tortuga about the smugglers"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub02_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub02_Desription"
msgid "Долговязый Бен сказал, что за контрабанду на архипелаге отвечает женщина по имени Марита. Если хочу докопаться до сути, мне нужно поговорить именно с ней."
msgstr "Long Ben said a woman named Marita runs the smuggling on the archipelago. If I want to get to the bottom of this, I need to talk to her."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub02_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub02_Goal"
msgid "Поговорить с Маритой на базе контрабандистов"
msgstr "Talk to Marita at the smugglers’ base"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub03_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub03_Desription"
msgid "Марита сказала, что от Хейла – ее поставщика – давно не было вестей. Нужно узнать, что его задерживает."
msgstr "Marita told me she has not heard from her supplier, Hale, in a long time. I need to find out what is keeping him."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub03_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub03_Goal"
msgid "Найти Хейла"
msgstr "Find Hale"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub04_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub04_Desription"
msgid "Хейлу уже не помочь. Вместо живого поставщика – труп и записка с очередным упоминанием некоего Генри. Надо доложить Марите."
msgstr "It’s too late to help Hale. I found his body and a note that mentioned someone named Henry again. I need to report back to Marita."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub04_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub04_Goal"
msgid "Вернуться к Марите"
msgstr "Return to Marita"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub05_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub05_Desription"
msgid "Марита уверена: о Генри и его врагах мне лучше спросить у трактирщика Бена. Кажется, он скрывает куда больше, чем кажется."
msgstr "Marita is sure I should ask the innkeeper, Ben, about Henry and his enemies. It seems he knows much more than he lets on."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub05_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub05_Goal"
msgid "Поговорить с Долговязым Беном в таверне"
msgstr "Talk to Long Ben in the tavern"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub06_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub06_Desription"
msgid "Бен признался, что когда-то носил имя Генри Эвери – знаменитого пирата. Именно за ним охотится капитан Марлоу – его старый подельник. За решение этой проблемы Бен пообещал хорошую награду"
msgstr "Ben confessed he once went by the name Henry Every, a famous pirate. Captain Marlowe, his old accomplice, is hunting him. Ben promised a good reward if I solve this problem."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub06_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub06_Goal"
msgid "Найти и утопить корабль Марлоу"
msgstr "Find and sink Marlowe’s ship"

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub07_Desription
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub07_Desription"
msgid "Марлоу больше не будет преследовать контрабандистов и Бена. Осталось вернуться к трактирщику и сообщить ему добрые вести."
msgstr "Marlowe will no longer chase the smugglers or Ben. All that remains is to return to the innkeeper and share the good news."

#. Key:	Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub07_Goal
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
#: Localization/Data/ScenarioQuests.csv
msgctxt "ScenarioQuests,Quest_SideQuest_UndergroundWeb_Sub07_Goal"
msgid "Сообщить Бену, что Марлоу мертв"
msgstr "Tell Ben that Marlowe is dead"

