#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_AntiAliasing"
msgid "Anti-Aliasing reduces jagged edges on 3D objects. Higher settings make edges smoother, but may reduce performance."
msgstr "Anti-Aliasing reduces jagged edges on 3D objects. Higher settings make edges smoother, but may reduce performance."

#. Key:	Settings_Description_AudioOutputDevice
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
