#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_AutoSetQuality"
msgid "Automatically configure the graphics quality options based on a benchmark of the hardware."
msgstr "Automatically configures the graphics quality options based on your hardware benchmark."

#. Key:	Settings_Description_BackgroundAudio
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_BackgroundAudio"
msgid "Turns game audio on/off when the game is in the background. When on, the game audio will continue to play when the game is minimized, or another window is focused."
msgstr "Turns game audio on/off when the game is in the background. When on, the game audio will continue to play when the game is minimized, or another window is focused."

#. Key:	Settings_Description_Bloom
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_Bloom"
msgid "Bloom is a real world light phenomena that can greatly add to the perceived realism of a rendered image at a moderate render performance cost."
msgstr "Bloom is a real-world light phenomenon that can greatly enhance the perceived realism of a rendered image at a moderate render performance cost."

#. Key:	Settings_Description_Brightness
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
