#. Key:	Settings_Description_DashInputDirectionRegistrationDelay
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_DashInputDirectionRegistrationDelay"
msgid "Amount of time in second the game waits after you've pressed Dash button to begin its execution.\r\nWhen using Dash, if you feel that movement direction is wrong (it may happen if you press Dash and movement direction input very close to eachother), consider increasing it a little.\r\n\r\nIncrease carefully, as this setting basically adds \"lag\" to responsiveness of your Dash input"
msgstr "The time in seconds that the game waits to perform Dash after you have pressed the corresponding button.\r\nWhen using Dash, if you feel that movement direction is wrong (it may happen if you press Dash and movement direction input very close to each other), consider increasing the parameter a little.\r\n\r\nIncrease the setting carefully, as it basically increases the response time of the Dash input"

#. Key:	Settings_Description_Dialogue
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
