msgid "High Dynamic Range (HDR) displays taking advantage of features such as higher contrast and wider color gamut"
msgstr "High Dynamic Range (HDR) displays provide for features such as higher contrast and a wider color gamut."

#. Key:	Settings_Description_HoldToGather
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_HoldToGather"
msgid "[EXPERIMENTAL] When this option is On, while mining or cutting wood, your character will keep gathering nearby resources as long as you hold the Attack button, until Stamina runs out."
msgstr "[EXPERIMENTAL] When this option is On, while mining or cutting wood, your character will keep gathering nearby resources as long as you hold the Attack button, until Stamina runs out."

