#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_LookSensitivityAds"
msgid "How quickly your view rotates while aiming down sights (ADS)."
msgstr "Determines how quickly your view rotates while aiming down sights (ADS)."

#. Key:	Settings_Description_MonitorSelector
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_MonitorSelector"
msgid "Change Display"
msgstr "Change Display"

#. Key:	Settings_Description_MotionBlur
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_MotionBlur"
msgid "Motion blur is the apparent streaking of moving objects in a photograph or a sequence of frames, such as a film or animation."
msgstr "Motion blur is a visual effect that simulates the blur of fast-moving objects or the blurring of the camera's view when capturing fast motion."

#. Key:	Settings_Description_MouseSensitivityPitch
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_MouseSensitivityPitch"
msgid "Sets the sensitivity of the mouse's vertical (y) axis. With higher settings the camera will move faster when looking up and down with the mouse."
msgstr "Sets the sensitivity of the mouse vertical axis (y-axis). With higher settings, the camera will move faster when looking up and down with the mouse."

#. Key:	Settings_Description_MouseSensitivityYaw
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_MouseSensitivityYaw"
msgid "Sets the sensitivity of the mouse's horizontal (x) axis. With higher settings the camera will move faster when looking left and right with the mouse."
msgstr "Sets the sensitivity of the mouse horizontal axis (x-axis). With higher settings, the camera will move faster when looking left and right with the mouse."

#. Key:	Settings_Description_MusicVolume
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_MusicVolume"
msgid "Adjusts the volume of music."
msgstr "Adjusts the music volume."

#. Key:	Settings_Description_OverallVolume
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_OverallVolume"
msgid "Adjusts the volume of everything."
msgstr "Adjusts the master volume."

#. Key:	Settings_Description_PostProcessing
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_PostProcessing"
msgid "Post Processing effects include Motion Blur, Depth of Field and Bloom. Increasing this setting improves the quality of post process effects, but can reduce performance"
msgstr "Post-Processing effects include Motion Blur, Depth of Field and Bloom. Increasing this setting improves the quality of post-processing effects, but can affect performance"

#. Key:	Settings_Description_PressAnykeyToMap
