msgstr "Enabling Vertical Sync eliminates screen tearing by always rendering and presenting a full frame. Disabling Vertical Sync can give higher frame rate and better input response, but can result in horizontal screen tearing"

#. Key:	Settings_Description_Vibration
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
