#. Key:	Settings_Description_WindowMode
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/Settings.csv
#: Localization/Data/Settings.csv
msgctxt "Settings,Settings_Description_WindowMode"
msgid "In Windowed mode you can interact with other windows more easily, and drag the edges of the window to set the size. In Borderless Window mode you can easily switch between applications. In Fullscreen mode you cannot interact with other windows as easily, but the game will run slightly faster."
msgstr "In Windowed mode you can interact with other windows more easily, and drag the edges of the window to set the size. In Borderless Window mode you can easily switch between applications. In Fullscreen mode you cannot interact with other windows as easily, but the game will run slightly faster."

