msgid "Brig | Blackbeard Variant"
msgstr "Brig | Blackbeard Variant"

#. Key:	Ship_BrigBrethren_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ShipUI.csv
#: Localization/Data/ShipUI.csv
msgctxt "ShipUI,Ship_BrigBrethren_Description"
msgid "A brig is a versatile war-capable ship that stands between trader and warship. Favored by captains who expect trouble.\r\n\r\nКорабли Братства — настоящие морские крепости благодаря крайне прочному корпусу и просторному трюму. Однако за это они расплачиваются скоростью."
msgstr "A brig is a versatile war-capable ship that stands between trader and warship. Favored by captains who expect trouble.\r\n\r\nBrethren ships are true sea fortresses, thanks to their exceptionally sturdy hulls and spacious holds. However, they pay for it with speed."

