#. Key:	Ship_FrigateBlackbeard_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ShipUI.csv
#: Localization/Data/ShipUI.csv
msgctxt "ShipUI,Ship_FrigateBlackbeard_Description"
msgid "A frigate is a true ship of war, meant to dominate open waters.\r\n\r\nКорабли Чернобородцев — прирождённые рейдеры. Они жертвуют бронёй и размером трюма, зато могут похвастаться скоростью и возможностью устанавливать пушки более крупного калибра."
msgstr "A frigate is a true ship of war, meant to dominate open waters.\r\n\r\nBlackbeard ships are natural-born raiders. They sacrifice armor and cargo hold space, but make up for it with speed and the ability to mount larger-caliber guns. However, the durability of their hulls leaves much to be desired."

#. Key:	Ship_FrigateBlackbeard_Name
