msgstr "Frigate | Blackbeard Variant"

#. Key:	Ship_FrigateBrethren_Description
#. SourceLocation:	Localization/Data/ShipUI.csv
#: Localization/Data/ShipUI.csv
msgctxt "ShipUI,Ship_FrigateBrethren_Description"
msgid "A frigate is a true ship of war, meant to dominate open waters.\r\n\r\nКорабли Братства — настоящие морские крепости благодаря крайне прочному корпусу и просторному трюму. Однако за это они расплачиваются скоростью."
msgstr "A frigate is a true ship of war, meant to dominate open waters.\r\n\r\nBrethren ships are true sea fortresses, thanks to their exceptionally sturdy hulls and spacious holds. However, they pay for it with speed."

